# >>> setup-agents (managed) >>>
# Regenerable / heavy / per-user setup-agents artifacts — safe to delete and re-generate.
# The shared state/ record (tasks, evidence, decisions, reviews, workflow-runs, handoffs,
# clarifications, lessons, estimates, sprints), config.json, project-knowledge.md, and insights/
# stay tracked so the team shares them. A few state/ files are per-person/per-machine runtime
# state, not part of that shared record, and are ignored individually below.
# rules/, skills/, sf-skills/, playbooks/, and profiles/ are NOT ignored by default, but ARE added
# below as proprietary generated files in customer-repository mode (see the heading below).
.setup-agents/references/
.setup-agents/sf-metadata-index.json
.setup-agents/chat-history/
.setup-agents/chat-debug.jsonl
.setup-agents/chat-permission-audit.jsonl
.setup-agents/tmp/
*.user-backup-*
.setup-agents/state/gate-approvals.jsonl
.setup-agents/state/spawn-sessions.jsonl
.setup-agents/state/permission-denials.jsonl
.setup-agents/state/phase-context/
.setup-agents/state/*.bak

